{"id":"n14025-3-5","stage":2,"title":"연출 · 演出","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14025-3-5-1","ko":"이분은 결혼식 연출을 맡아 주실 분이에요.","zh":"这位将负责婚礼的现场策划。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이분은","meaning":"这位","explanation":"이분：这位；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"이분","audio":"/audio/3c8662efe223818068ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71152","senseId":"1","lemma":"이분","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"결혼식","meaning":"婚礼","explanation":"결혼식：婚礼","readings":[{"term":"결혼식","audio":"/audio/95cfb1a60ed967ea5531.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31666","senseId":"1","lemma":"결혼식","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"연출을","meaning":"演出，表演","explanation":"연출：演出，表演；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"연출","audio":"/audio/5ff11937f7c84050f56a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14025","senseId":"3","lemma":"연출","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"맡아","meaning":"负责","explanation":"맡다：负责；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"맡다","audio":"/audio/0ce6c4ebbc3bfd2367dc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62827","senseId":"1","lemma":"맡다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"주실","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanation":"주다：为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"분이에요.","meaning":"位","explanation":"분：位；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；에요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"분","audio":"/audio/ca4a187881dbf529d05e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27780","senseId":"1","lemma":"분","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"3c8662efe2238180","term":"이분","zh":"这位","audio":"/audio/3c8662efe223818068ee.mp3","entryId":"71152","definition":"(高尊)这个人。","pronunciation":["이분"]},{"id":"95cfb1a60ed967ea","term":"결혼식","zh":"婚礼","audio":"/audio/95cfb1a60ed967ea5531.mp3","entryId":"31666","defi